{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>You shall not make with Me.</b> With My awe — above He warned you, and here 'with Me.' And if you say: since You command me not to make any likeness of a symbol, how shall I serve You? Scripture says: 'an altar of earth,' 'an altar of bronze,' 'hollow, with boards; you shall make it full of earth for Me,' 'and you shall sacrifice upon it' — this is the service."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:59:06.597621597Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}